@host = http://localhost:3000
@token = {{auth_token}}

### Generate a development JWT (disabled in production)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/dev-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "4b9fd3ab-cc8f-4d2f-b23d-2c2c7c7ac3a9",
  "role": "user",
  "email": "trader@example.com",
  "name": "Local Trader"
}

### Create a trade form
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tradeforms
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "USDT OTC escrow",
  "description": "P2P escrow with VC verification",
  "amount": "1000.00"
}

### Verify a counterparty credential
POST {{host}}/api/v1/tradeforms/{{trade_uid}}/verify-vc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credential": {
    "type": "VerifiableCredential",
    "issuer": "did:example:issuer",
    "credentialSubject": {
      "id": "did:example:counterparty"
    }
  }
}

### List your trade forms (filters optional)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/me/tradeforms?status=pending&page=1&page_size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
